+
+Keep the primary Codex session signed in with ChatGPT. Use Codex CLI 0.134.0 or later for named profiles. Create `routerai-review.config.toml` in your local `CODEX_HOME` (`~/.codex` by default). Put the model, provider and effort assignments before the first table.
